        </h2>
        <p className="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-300">
          East Asia&apos;s trio ??? China, Korea, Japan ??? finished{" "}
          {fmtPct(HEADLINE.eastAsiaTrioShare2024, 0)} of new merchant gross
          tonnage. Greece still owns the largest fleet by deadweight, while the
          United States builds roughly {fmtPct(HEADLINE.usBuildShare2024, 2)} of
          commercial GT. Ownership and construction are different maps.
        </p>
        <p className="mt-2 text-xs text-slate-400">{SOURCE_NOTE}</p>
      </div>

      <div className="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3">
        <ToggleGroup
          label="View"
          value={tab}
          onChange={setTab}
          options={[
            { id: "deliveries", label: "2024 deliveries" },
            { id: "trajectory", label: "East Asia path" },
            { id: "ownbuild", label: "Own vs build" },
            { id: "segments", label: "By ship type" },
            { id: "pipeline", label: "Contracts & book" },
